{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Poker + Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poker Monsters is exactly what it sounds like:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a Roguelike Deckbuilder Poker game in which you battle big boss Monsters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/3121f7a9752045400f6b7bb916a8b682.poster.avif?t=1771090164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/3121f7a9752045400f6b7bb916a8b682.webm?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/3121f7a9752045400f6b7bb916a8b682.mp4?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to defeat the opposing creature and continue your run, you\u2019ll have to assemble the best poker hands you can. The better the hand, the stronger the attack! But be careful, every Monster has its own way of throwing a wrench in your plans.<br><br>Guide a Party of papery heroes, each with its own helpful ability. Master the game\u2019s mechanics to bend the odds to your favour! Are you ready to put your strategic mind to the test?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt &amp; Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taking down big Monsters deserves equally big rewards!</strong>\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4b8a676f13bba1e70f879a1f858d36d8.poster.avif?t=1771090164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4b8a676f13bba1e70f879a1f858d36d8.webm?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4b8a676f13bba1e70f879a1f858d36d8.mp4?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each win you\u2019ll get to power up in 3 different ways, depending on the route you chose:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a new Hero joining your Party;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With new Cards and Items, that you can buy in the Shop;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fiendish Pacts, special contracts that power up your Combos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Everything!</strong> <br><strong>Your Deck, your Party, your Board</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Deck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ammount of cards in your deck is LITERALLY your HP!<br>It\u2019s up to you to strike the right balance between consistency and resilience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4562a304215f17e86fc5b78a375b006a.poster.avif?t=1771090164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4562a304215f17e86fc5b78a375b006a.webm?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4562a304215f17e86fc5b78a375b006a.mp4?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get more copies of cards needed for your preferred combinations and add them to your deck. The approach might be different but the goal is the same:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mold your deck into the most optimized destruction machine you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Party</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poker Monsters offers a variety of Heroes to recruit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/c88f0468a598284a457874978973cb8c.poster.avif?t=1771090164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/c88f0468a598284a457874978973cb8c.webm?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/c88f0468a598284a457874978973cb8c.mp4?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the Heroes you think are best suited for the Hunt and venture forth. Go wild and experiment with Party composition to find which adventurers work best together and use their abilities to gain the upper hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Board</strong><br>Deck and Party are not the only tools at your disposal, change the Board itself by getting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pacts, to change the power of your combos. Make Two Pair more powerful than Flush if you desire!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamps, to \u201crewrite\u201d your cards's property during the battle. Turn a 2 of Spades into a 2 of Hearts to get that Straight Flush just right! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/7b859d070106a6126c6cfeefac0e295f.poster.avif?t=1771090164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/7b859d070106a6126c6cfeefac0e295f.webm?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/7b859d070106a6126c6cfeefac0e295f.mp4?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768150?t=1771090164","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768150?t=1771090164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/c4964779ea798a0c71dd12cb22b6fb3286dcf050/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771090164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/c4964779ea798a0c71dd12cb22b6fb3286dcf050/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771090164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4329230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Poker + Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poker Monsters is exactly what it sounds like:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a Roguelike Deckbuilder Poker game in which you battle big boss Monsters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/3121f7a9752045400f6b7bb916a8b682.poster.avif?t=1771090164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/3121f7a9752045400f6b7bb916a8b682.webm?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/3121f7a9752045400f6b7bb916a8b682.mp4?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to defeat the opposing creature and continue your run, you\u2019ll have to assemble the best poker hands you can. The better the hand, the stronger the attack! But be careful, every Monster has its own way of throwing a wrench in your plans.<br><br>Guide a Party of papery heroes, each with its own helpful ability. Master the game\u2019s mechanics to bend the odds to your favour! Are you ready to put your strategic mind to the test?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt &amp; Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taking down big Monsters deserves equally big rewards!</strong>\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4b8a676f13bba1e70f879a1f858d36d8.poster.avif?t=1771090164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4b8a676f13bba1e70f879a1f858d36d8.webm?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4b8a676f13bba1e70f879a1f858d36d8.mp4?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each win you\u2019ll get to power up in 3 different ways, depending on the route you chose:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a new Hero joining your Party;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With new Cards and Items, that you can buy in the Shop;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fiendish Pacts, special contracts that power up your Combos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Everything!</strong> <br><strong>Your Deck, your Party, your Board</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Deck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ammount of cards in your deck is LITERALLY your HP!<br>It\u2019s up to you to strike the right balance between consistency and resilience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4562a304215f17e86fc5b78a375b006a.poster.avif?t=1771090164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4562a304215f17e86fc5b78a375b006a.webm?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/4562a304215f17e86fc5b78a375b006a.mp4?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get more copies of cards needed for your preferred combinations and add them to your deck. The approach might be different but the goal is the same:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mold your deck into the most optimized destruction machine you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Party</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poker Monsters offers a variety of Heroes to recruit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/c88f0468a598284a457874978973cb8c.poster.avif?t=1771090164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/c88f0468a598284a457874978973cb8c.webm?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/c88f0468a598284a457874978973cb8c.mp4?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the Heroes you think are best suited for the Hunt and venture forth. Go wild and experiment with Party composition to find which adventurers work best together and use their abilities to gain the upper hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Board</strong><br>Deck and Party are not the only tools at your disposal, change the Board itself by getting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pacts, to change the power of your combos. Make Two Pair more powerful than Flush if you desire!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamps, to \u201crewrite\u201d your cards's property during the battle. Turn a 2 of Spades into a 2 of Hearts to get that Straight Flush just right! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/7b859d070106a6126c6cfeefac0e295f.poster.avif?t=1771090164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/7b859d070106a6126c6cfeefac0e295f.webm?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/extras/7b859d070106a6126c6cfeefac0e295f.mp4?t=1771090164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Un-Lock Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768150/2613d754d6762fe3856e9a517106fc943a53ec07/header.jpg?t=1771090164","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768150/906047974/82cfc2697064968855d0d47b219d1f27de28c0d4/1767862497/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768236777","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768150/906047974/82cfc2697064968855d0d47b219d1f27de28c0d4/1767862497/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768236777","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768150/906047974/82cfc2697064968855d0d47b219d1f27de28c0d4/1767862497/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768236777","id":257206275,"name":"Desert Demo - Gameplay Trailer","thumbna